{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04408","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 三十四 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 三十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朔风吹海树，萧条边已秋。\n亭上谁家子，哀哀明月楼。\n自言幽燕客，结发事远游。\n赤丸杀公吏，白刃报私雠。\n避雠至海上，被役此边州。\n故乡三千里，辽水复悠悠。\n每愤胡兵入，常爲汉国羞。\n何知七十战，白首未封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}